Array A(r, n) of number of independent components of a symmetric traceless tensor of rank r and dimension n, written as triangle T(n, r) = A(r, n-r+2), n >= 1, r = 2..n+1.

The 55 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A264357

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [0, 2, 0, 5, 2, 0, 9, 7, 2, 0,
    14, 16, 9, 2, 0, 20, 30, 25, 11, 2,
    0, 27, 50, 55, 36, 13, 2, 0, 35, 77,
